# Framer Motion Animation Guidelines

## Animation Principles

### Performance-First Animations
- Use transform properties (`x`, `y`, `scale`, `rotate`) instead of layout properties
- Prefer `opacity` changes over `display` or `visibility`
- Use `will-change: transform` for frequently animated elements
- Avoid animating `width`, `height`, `top`, `left` directly

### Timing and Easing
```typescript
// Standard duration values
const durations = {
  fast: 0.2,
  normal: 0.3,
  slow: 0.6,
  verySlow: 1.5
};

// Standard easing functions
const easings = {
  easeOut: [0.0, 0.0, 0.2, 1],
  easeIn: [0.4, 0.0, 1, 1],
  easeInOut: [0.4, 0.0, 0.2, 1],
  bounce: [0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55]
};
```

## Animation Patterns from Project

### Stagger Animation Pattern (from [HeroSection.tsx](mdc:src/components/sections/HeroSection.tsx))
```typescript
const containerVariants = {
  hidden: { opacity: 0 },
  visible: {
    opacity: 1,
    transition: {
      staggerChildren: 0.2, // Stagger child animations by 0.2s
    },
  },
};

const itemVariants = {
  hidden: { y: 20, opacity: 0 },
  visible: {
    y: 0,
    opacity: 1,
    transition: {
      duration: 0.6,
    },
  },
};

// Usage
<motion.div
  variants={containerVariants}
  initial="hidden"
  animate="visible"
>
  <motion.h1 variants={itemVariants}>Heading</motion.h1>
  <motion.p variants={itemVariants}>Paragraph</motion.p>
  <motion.div variants={itemVariants}>Buttons</motion.div>
</motion.div>
```

### Infinite Loop Animation Pattern
```typescript
// Continuous scroll indicator (from HeroSection)
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 0 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 10 }}
  transition={{
    delay: 1.5,
    duration: 1.5,
    repeat: Infinity,
    repeatType: "reverse",
    ease: "easeInOut",
  }}
>
  <ScrollIndicator />
</motion.div>
```

### Hover Animation Pattern (from [MagicButton.tsx](mdc:src/components/ui/MagicButton.tsx))
```typescript
const [hovered, setHovered] = useState(false);

<motion.div
  animate={{
    backgroundPosition: hovered ? ["0% 0%", "100% 0%"] : "0% 0%",
  }}
  transition={{
    duration: 1.5,
    ease: "easeInOut",
  }}
  onMouseEnter={() => setHovered(true)}
  onMouseLeave={() => setHovered(false)}
>
  <motion.div whileTap={{ scale: 0.97 }}>
    Content
  </motion.div>
</motion.div>
```

## Common Animation Recipes

### Page/Section Entrance
```typescript
const sectionVariants = {
  hidden: { 
    opacity: 0,
    y: 50
  },
  visible: { 
    opacity: 1,
    y: 0,
    transition: {
      duration: 0.6,
      ease: "easeOut"
    }
  }
};
```

### Button Interactions
```typescript
// Tap animation
<motion.button
  whileTap={{ scale: 0.97 }}
  whileHover={{ scale: 1.05 }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}
>

// Loading state
const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false);

<motion.button
  animate={isLoading ? { scale: [1, 1.05, 1] } : { scale: 1 }}
  transition={isLoading ? { repeat: Infinity, duration: 1 } : {}}
>
```

### Modal/Menu Animations
```typescript
// Slide in from top
const menuVariants = {
  closed: {
    y: "-100%",
    opacity: 0,
    transition: {
      duration: 0.3,
      ease: "easeIn"
    }
  },
  open: {
    y: 0,
    opacity: 1,
    transition: {
      duration: 0.3,
      ease: "easeOut"
    }
  }
};

// Backdrop fade
const backdropVariants = {
  closed: { opacity: 0 },
  open: { opacity: 1 }
};
```

### List Item Animations
